		{
			title: "The Puppet Master"
			x: 1.0d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5So, we mentioned the Puppet Master and how Celeve is always the world that is being punished by the FOP."
				""
				"&dUsually worlds they digitize have no chance of fighting back, and just... vanish. No one really gets out, and stories aren't believed. That's all in part to the FOP's Puppet Master, who rules over Celeve with an iron squeaky hammer."
				""
				"&5And when a world succeeds in fighting back in some way, it gets 'punished' and given to the master of Celeve. The boss of this world, the Puppet Master, is known as Gyro. He is also called The Final Act."
				""
				"&dA gruesome nod to how they treat the punished world. Infecting them with a virus to turn them into rabid clowns, and eventually destroying their world when the next one needs to be punished."
			]
			dependencies: ["2D2B122DDFFB7D30"]
			id: "207D8FFCE6B3F07D"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6D64342BA3763E4B"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: 3.25d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5If you are wanting to deal with Gyro, there's only one path forward : destroying the puppet master. No bribe option this time, unfortunately."
				""
				"&dGyro loves his job too much to be bribed, and the pain he's inflicted on planet after planet can't be ignored. I mean, just look at all the clowns. A job that's supposed to be fun, turned into a deadly horror show."
				""
				"&5So get yourself ready, Bandit. Arm up, armor up, make sure you got ways to jump, fly, or teleport cause you might need it. "
				""
				"&dThen, find yourself a Toy Merchant. One you've leveled up a bit, as the friendly clowns of Celeve won't risk your death if they don't trust you."
				""
				"&5Buy yourself a Toy Gyrocopter. Then find a nice, big island area you can run around on safely."
			]
			dependencies: ["207D8FFCE6B3F07D"]
			id: "215BBBAF71A8819C"
			tasks: [{
				id: "06BB538943232467"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:toy_gyrocopter"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "154A577038228AF9"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Flight of the Funny"
			x: 4.5d
			y: -1.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&5When you Right Click the Toy Gyrocopter, it will summon Gyro's gyrocopter. He loves his vehicle, and will not be far behind it."
				""
				"&dHis gyrocopter will float upward until he appears, and then he'll be very angry. He has a bottomless sack of ammo and will fire nonstop at you while flying around. "
				""
				"&5Basically he'll do his best to just overrun you with bullets. He has a ton of health and keeps moving, so plan accordingly."
				""
				"&dIf you beat him, there's a bunch of weapons he has a chance of dropping. Along with various amounts of ammo for guns, coins, etc."
			]
			dependencies: ["215BBBAF71A8819C"]
