		{
			title: "A Realm of Lies"
			x: -5.25d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&dOne of the two dimensions you can get to from Lelyetia is Haven..."
				""
				"&5...a peaceful world thats but a false face..."
				""
				"&dMost of the creatures on Haven are peaceful. But there's a dark secret to uncover. Getting there isn't too hard, though."
				""
				"&5You'll need to bring a Blank Realmstone up to the top of the upper trees in Lelyetia. Then kill a Flye with a melee attack while up there."
				""
				"&dAs long as you are above, say, Y 120, killing a Flye with melee should do the trick."
				""
				"&5Like Lelyetia, be sure to bring grappling hooks, flying gear, etc. Haven is made up of large, floating islands."
			]
			dependencies: ["5CCB73FF0AB748D0"]
