		{
			title: "A Pretty Veneer"
			x: -3.5d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dYou'll notice most every creature here is peaceful, Bandit. Docile."
				""
				"&5Mostly. And they were made that way. A lot of these creatures are... twisted manipulations by the FOP."
				""
				"&dWell, in progress ones. Testing, mutations, splicing, this is one of the 'test' worlds for the FOP. "
				""
				"&5They are working to create dangerous mutations and viruses, using these docile works as testing grounds."
				""
				"&dYou can see it especially if you go to certain areas, or attack specific creatures. The defenses come online, guards appear, etc."
			]
			dependencies: ["07566848A25F5008"]
