		{
			title: "Weightless"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&dThere is only one ore you can find in Haven, and that is called Crystallite."
				""
				"&5It's an interesting ore, its structure modified by the FOP for testing purposes. One that has lead to the creation of Floating Rocks."
				""
				"&dYeah, those are much more.... unique. You can find them on most defensive guardians, as well as the multiple Bosses. They can also just... appear from various different blocks you break, weirdly enough. But its fairly rare."
				""
				"&5We figure the FOP was trying to work out some teleporting technology and it didn't go quite right. Best guess we have right now."
