		{
			x: 1.0d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dTechnically, there are are two bosses of Haven : The Guardians of the Haven system..."
				""
				"&5...and the 'strongest' experiment to date."
				""
				"&dI'm not sure if we'll be able to bribe either of them, Bandit. But we'll look into it. It may not be so much a bribe as instead a..."
				""
				"&5...workaround."
