		{
			title: "Rocking It"
			x: 3.25d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dThe 'strongest' experiment that Haven has produced is called Rockrider, nicknamed The Duo."
				""
				"&5This is because it's two of their experiments that got combined. In essence, they are one entity but...not? It's hard to explain."
				""
				"&dEither way, they are tough. Quite tough. And to get their attention, you'll need to throw down a challenge to them."
				""
				"&5You do this by creating a Heavy Boulder. Get one of those Floating Stones, and....throw it into the void. Usually just off the side of one of the sky islands."
				""
				"&dIt'll reappear high in the sky and fall back down the same area. You'll want to catch it for later."
			]
			dependencies: ["4801694875CA6CA9"]
			id: "7AD8FF7AF46E5F0B"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1618D4608B3C9CA4"
