			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Tough as Nails"
			x: 4.5d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS BRIBE"
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, we figured out a way you can get past Rockrider without actually fighting them."
				""
				"&5Well, you ARE going to challenge them, in a way. They love a challenge, it's what they were created for. "
				""
				"&dThey perhaps like being challenged a bit TOO much, even if its not an outright fight challenge."
				""
				"&5So you can challenge them to a game of strength. Just how powerful are they against some strong materials?"
				""
				"&dCompressing Obsidian twice over should be a good test. As well as giving them Wither armor, to see which breaks first: the armor or them."
				""
				"&5Don't forget, sis. Since they are a two in one being, they'll need two full sets."
				""
				"&dOh right right."
			]
