		{
			title: "Protecting the Heart"
			x: 3.25d
			y: 4.75d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&dThe main protection system for Haven comes in the form of Guardians. Entities built and programmed to protect the FOP's important experiments on Haven's denizens."
				""
				"&5Part of why you get Spirit Guardians and Protectors if you attempt to hurt an Eeo. And only an Eeo, since everything else is a finished experiment."
				""
				"&dBut if you want to face the overall protectors of Haven, you'll need to summon them by finding a Voliant Heart."
				""
				"&5You can find these on the Spirit Guardians we mentioned earlier. Then you'll need to find a Guardian Tower, and climb to the large purple arena at the top."
				""
				"&dThese are the data centers for the Four Guardians, the main protectors of Haven. Oh! Bring some Redstone! You'll need it as well."
			]
			dependencies: ["4801694875CA6CA9"]
			id: "2E8A33A3CEF3A888"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5BB066C414BB30E8"
				type: "item"
				item: "aoa3:voliant_heart"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "61A84624F6DFF6B6"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Unfair Match"
			x: 4.5d
			y: 4.0d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&dFound the Guardian Tower? Good work, Bandit! You'll need to climb to the top where the platform is. "
				""
				"&5Got that Redstone sis asked you to bring? You'll see four levers, one on each wall. You'll need to finish the Redstone connections, turn on the Levers, and finally Right Click the Volatile Heart onto the Guardian Altar in the center."
				""
				"&dThis will summon the Four Guardians in attack mode. Each one will fire projectiles at you as they fly around, each Guardian's shot causing a different effect if it hits you."
				""
				"&5Slowness, Blindness, explosions: the projectiles are all dangerous so be careful, Bandit. "
				""
				"&dFor defeating the Guardians, you might get a sword, or a special gun depending which one you defeat last."
			]
			dependencies: ["2E8A33A3CEF3A888"]
			id: "0E5F29F829FC5044"
			tasks: [{
				id: "300CE25A8652E682"
				type: "item"
				item: "kubejs:boss_card_four_guardians"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "42C786840272997A"
